      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start. To round out my lit review, I also need to address the counter-perspective to ensure I'm not being one-sided. Could you then provide the main arguments used to defend the validity and objectivity of IQ and standardized testing as tools for measuring merit? I want to see how a proponent would respond to those sociological critiques.",
